+- Program/gate state: `evidence/PROGRAM_ACCEPTANCE_LEDGER.md` and the
+  authoritative gate ledger `evidence/closeout/GATE_LEDGER.csv`.
+- Active state: `evidence/CURRENT_STATE.json`.
+- Product definition and roadmap: `docs/product/`.
+
+| File | What it is |
+| --- | --- |
+| `agent_final_response.json` | Phase-1 publication response (review reconciliation rounds). |
+| `ext_review.md` | External review / production-grade roadmap (superseded by `docs/product/`). |
+| `reviewer.md` | Independent-review checklist. |
+| `GATE_LEDGER.csv` | Historical round-3 gate note (the authoritative ledger is `evidence/closeout/GATE_LEDGER.csv`). |
